# The directory and the session secret live in the DB D1 database bound in
# wrangler.jsonc (the committed fixture render — wrangler provides a local
# SQLite behind it; `pnpm db:migrate:local` creates the tables and the demo
# users there — and, on deploy, rendered from the cloudflare-d1 root's wiring
# document).
#
# Liveblocks: without a key the site serves with a "Liveblocks is not
# connected" dashboard. For local work put your project's secret key in
# apps/web/.dev.vars (wrangler dev) or .env.local (next dev) — never commit it.
# LIVEBLOCKS_SECRET_KEY=sk_dev_...
# LIVEBLOCKS_WEBHOOK_SECRET_KEY=whsec_...
